@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction

actor "用户" as User
actor "商家" as Merchant

rectangle "用户端移动 H5\n(frontend/user-h5/\nVue 3 + Vite + Pinia)" as UserFrontend
rectangle "商家端桌面 Web 后台\n(frontend/merchant-admin/\nReact 18 + Vite + AntD 5)" as MerchantFrontend
rectangle "Java 后端服务\n(backend/\nSpring Boot, :8080)" as Backend
database "MySQL 数据库\n(local, 3306)" as DB

User --> UserFrontend : 浏览器访问
Merchant --> MerchantFrontend : 浏览器访问

UserFrontend --> Backend : HTTP /api/v1/**\n(JSON + Cookie Session)
MerchantFrontend --> Backend : HTTP /api/v1/merchant/**\n(JSON + Cookie Session)

Backend --> DB : JDBC (读写业务数据)
Backend --> Backend : Session 管理\n统一响应与异常
@enduml
